h1 メモイラスト
p.lead メモや文章から、キーワードを抽出してイラストを生成します。

= render "shared/sd_catalog_status"

p = link_to "新しいイラストを生成", new_memo_illustration_path, class: "button"

- if @memo_illustrations.any?
  section.card-list
    - @memo_illustrations.each do |illustration|
      = link_to memo_illustration_path(illustration), class: "card" do
        .card-header
          span class="status status-#{illustration.status}" = illustration.status
          span.model = illustration.sd_model
        p.prompt = truncate(illustration.body, length: 80)
        - if illustration.image.attached?
          = image_tag illustration.image.variant(resize_to_limit: [256, 256]), alt: illustration.body
- else
  p.empty まだ生成履歴がありません。
